cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use the IWCS-Dataset, please cite the Zenodo dataset record below."
title: "IWCS-Dataset: Simulation Dataset for Cyberattack Analysis in IIoT Wireless Sensor Networks"
type: dataset
authors:
  - family-names: "Lo Nunes"
    given-names: "Osvaldo Sebastião"
year: 2026
date-released: 2026-06-13
version: "1.0.0"
doi: "10.5281/zenodo.20602871"
url: "https://zenodo.org/records/20602871"
repository-code: "https://github.com/Electrosvalnunes/iwcs-dataset-omnetpp-iiot-wsn-attacks"
license: "CC-BY-4.0"
abstract: >-
  IWCS-Dataset is a simulation-based dataset for cyberattack analysis in
  Industrial Internet of Things wireless sensor networks. The released V1
  contains 20,331 curated records and 16 attributes from four grid topology
  labels and five controlled operating conditions.
keywords:
  - Industrial Internet of Things
  - IIoT
  - Wireless Sensor Networks
  - WSN
  - Cybersecurity
  - OMNeT++
  - INET
  - RPL
  - IEEE 802.15.4
  - Dataset
